    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"   # descomentar y completar si tienes ORCID
abstract: >-
  ImageJ/Fiji macros, Python scripts and example data for the geometric
  calibration and the spatial-resolution (MTF) characterization of an
  open-architecture X-ray microtomograph, developed for an undergraduate
  thesis in Physics.
keywords:
  - X-ray microtomography
  - micro-CT
  - geometric calibration
  - modulation transfer function
  - spatial resolution
  - ImageJ
  - Fiji
